5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Let's be thorough. I want to ensure our reporting process remains sustainable as we scale.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. I'm particularly interested in the operational support these companies will require from us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I believe understanding the true relationship with customers is quite precious.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll be looking into our financial flexibility and the long-term obligations we might face.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'm less interested in the financials and more in the actual timeline of deployment. Let's see who is actually capable of delivering.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, since you mentioned operational support, perhaps we should look at the adviser networks as well.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"That is a thoughtful suggestion, Mizuki. I will keep that in mind.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,Everyone seems so focused. Let's remember to be kind to ourselves during this process.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
