35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,I've found some concerning patterns regarding our reporting and audit burdens.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,I see. I've discovered that our capacity to provide human capital is quite strained in specific areas.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,I found it very interesting to see who their customers truly love. Some bonds are stronger than others.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Our liquidity is more fragile than I hoped. The credit line is too restrictive for our current assets.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shion,,"It seems we are all discovering flaws. I've found that the ""unforeseen"" delays are actually quite predictable based on the product type.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Misaki, if liquidity is an issue, we cannot afford a company that complicates our audit process or adds reporting lag.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. We should avoid any candidate that will demand an immediate, heavy lift from our partners' time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"Perhaps we should look for a company that has a quiet, steady loyalty from its users.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"Exactly. We need a candidate that doesn't trigger immediate, heavy follow-on calls or rely on unbillable security.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shion,,"If you want stability, avoid anything that requires a security review from a legacy institution. It's a black hole for time.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"It sounds like we are leaning toward a candidate with a simple, verifiable reporting structure.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Yes, and one that doesn't require us to act as a full-time recruitment agency for their management.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I feel a gentle preference for the one whose customers stayed even when the price went up. That is true trust.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'm concerned about the burn rate of the fund itself. We cannot take a risk on a ""high-maintenance"" seed.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shion,,Then the choice is simple. We eliminate the ones that depend on external approvals they cannot control.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
