60,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,I strongly oppose Candidate C and D. Physical assets and depots will make our quarter-end reporting a nightmare.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. Candidate C requires field crews and supervisors, which our recruiters cannot find quickly. I vote for Candidate B.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shizue,,I feel very warmly toward Candidate A and D. Their customers show a lovely kind of loyalty. I prefer Candidate A.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Candidate B is the safest. It's a pure software play with predictable costs and no physical infrastructure to borrow against.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shion,,Candidate A is a trap. Medical records mean a security review that will stall us for nine months. Candidate B is the only logical choice.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, I understand the loyalty in A, but the reporting for medical software is often opaque. B is transparent.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,B is also the least demanding on our partners' board time. It's a lean operation.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"I see your points. It is a shame to overlook the heart of the customer, but I understand the need for peace in our accounts.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"If we choose B, we minimize the risk of an early follow-on call that we cannot fund.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shion,,Exactly. B avoids the hardware delays of D and the security purgatory of A. It's the only one that actually launches on time.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I am satisfied with Candidate B. It keeps our reporting clean and our audit costs low.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am also satisfied. It allows us to maintain our inner peace without constant recruitment crises.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"If you all feel so strongly, I shall support you. I only hope the customers of B are as happy as those of A.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I can support B. It protects the fund's remaining liquidity.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shion,,"Finally, we've reached a conclusion based on reality rather than hope.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
